            'MAPS)'#13 +
            #13 +
            '"SOME WHO WIELD STRONG'#13 +
            'SUPERNATURAL FORCES CAN'#13 +
            'BEND THE PATH LIKE AN'#13 +
            'ENGINEER DAMMING A RIVER.'#13 +
